{"id": "1528814100413546616", "channel_id": "1528814100413546616", "author_id": "426270111381454855", "author_name": "a275", "content": "Hello Morimens Support Team,\n\nI am writing to report an audio issue I encountered while using the \"Dream Recollection\" (story replay) feature.\n\nLocation: Story stages that include battles within \"Dream Recollection\".\n\nDescription: When replaying these specific stories, the Lobby BGM plays incorrectly instead of the appropriate stage background music.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nEnter the \"Dream Recollection\" menu.\n\nStart replaying a story that contains a battle stage.\n\nNotice that the Lobby BGM plays during the story progression instead of the correct BGM.\n\nThis issue distracts from the story immersion, so I kindly request you to look into it and apply a fix.", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T17:21:25.531000+00:00", "thread_id": "1528814100413546616"}
