{"id": "1528724438588330054", "channel_id": "1528724438588330054", "author_id": "306081208033345536", "author_name": "janustradamus", "content": "As some cards, especially those with additional damage scaling from sources beside an awakener's ATK end up being quite wordy (sometimes to the point where text starts to scroll), I'd like to suggest omitting the phrasing (\"X% Tentacle DMG/Counter/Strength bonus\") from the card text and replacing it with icons (either in the card text itself or in the top left where it's visible even in a hand with 12+ cards).\nThe exact amount of scaling can still be viewable in the pop-up tooltip.\n\nAlso, the templating of aliemus gain on cards is inconsistent, in some instances it is ``Gain X Aliemus`` and in other ``\"Awakener\" obtains X Aliemus``.", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T11:25:08.486000+00:00", "thread_id": "1528724438588330054", "reactions": [{"emoji": "👎", "emoji_id": null, "count": 3}, {"emoji": "Doll_fail", "emoji_id": "1356083552923422770", "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1528724439288647790", "filename": "templating.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 580087, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1528724438588330054/1528724439288647790/templating.png?ex=6a5fffd4&is=6a5eae54&hm=c2cf277b7c2d218b6efe7749144a621911f0188f8ef6b0463fa9aab2b999454a&"}]}
